{"title":"Grayback Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 26 Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf?lv=26\">Lv 26</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf?lv=23\" title=\"Pick level 23\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>9</td><td>in the wilds around -293, -918</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>8</td><td>in the wilds around -285, -927</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>25</b></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>5</td><td>in the wilds around -285, -963</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/grayback-wolf?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"grayback-wolf\" data-map-level=\"25\">Show level 25 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-883.2px,840.6px)\"><i style=\"left:840.1px;top:-848.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:988.0px;top:-825.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:966.6px;top:-770.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:932.3px;top:-937.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:1025.8px;top:-787.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:1003.8px;top:-777.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:914.4px;top:-787.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:875.9px;top:-888.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:949.7px;top:-892.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:864.6px;top:-816.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:856.6px;top:-855.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:897.9px;top:-823.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:816.8px;top:-832.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:1005.1px;top:-858.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:884.1px;top:-864.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:893.8px;top:-862.8px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around -291, -933 <span class=\"muted\">· 10 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -203, -930 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around -302, -1002 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"grayback-wolf\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Wolf: <a href=\"#/monster/wolf\">Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(2)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/dire-wolf\">Dire Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-wolf\">Elder Wolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/eae2d44b689391d4118d.svg\" alt=\"Grayback Wolf\"></div><h3>Grayback Wolf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 26)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Wolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>89</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>18.3</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,250</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>2.9 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>20 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}